{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24435","headline":"与牛家妓乐雨後合宴 · 白居易","name":"与牛家妓乐雨後合宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉管清弦声旖旎，翠钗红袖坐参差。\n两家合奏洞房夜，八月连阴秋雨时。\n歌脸有情凝睇久，舞腰无力转帬迟。\n人间欢乐无过此，上界西方即不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}